{"step_index":35,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T20:08:50Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-20T01:38:50+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-09-20T01:38:55+05:30\nThe search for \"Apple Mac Mini M4 32GB price India 2025 apple.com/in Mac Pro iMac all desktop Mac prices\" returned the following summary:\nAs of September 2026, here is the information regarding Apple desktop Mac pricing in India. Please note that prices can vary based on specific configurations, ongoing promotions, and retail channels.\n\n### **Mac mini (M4 Chip)**\nThe Mac mini with the M4 chip, launched in late 2024, is available in various memory and storage configurations.\n*   **Base Model Pricing:** The official launch price for the base model (M4 chip, 16GB RAM, 256GB SSD) was **₹59,900**.\n*   **Market Pricing:** During 2025, the model saw effective prices as low as **₹49,999** through promotional discounts and bank offers on platforms like Amazon.\n*   **Customization:** Apple allows you to configure the Mac mini with up to **32GB of unified memory** (and higher) and various storage options. Pricing for these higher-spec models increases accordingly based on the specific memory and SSD selection chosen on the [Apple India Online Store](https://www.apple.com/in).\n\n### **iMac (24-inch, M4 Chip)**\nThe 24-inch iMac powered by the M4 chip is the current all-in-one desktop offering from Apple.\n*   The iMac is available in multiple colors and configurations.\n*   Pricing varies significantly depending on the CPU/GPU core count, memory (starting at 16GB), and storage capacity.\n*   For exact pricing of a specific configuration (e.g., 32GB RAM upgrades), it is recommended to check the [official Apple iMac page](https://www.apple.com/in/shop/buy-mac/imac), as the price updates dynamically based on your chosen hardware specifications.\n\n### **Mac Pro**\n*   The Mac Pro remains Apple's professional-grade desktop workstation. As a high-end, modular device, it is typically priced much higher than the Mac mini or iMac.\n*   Due to its nature as a custom-configured workstation, Apple does not list a single \"base\" price in the same way as consumer models; pricing is determined by the specific Apple Silicon chip (M-series Ultra/Max variations), RAM, SSD, and expansion card selections.\n\n### **General Purchasing Information**\n*   **Education Pricing:** Students, teachers, and staff can often purchase these models at a discount through the [Apple Education Store](https://www.apple.com/in/shop/education-pricing).\n*   **Offers:** Apple India frequently runs promotions including **No Cost EMI** (typically 3–6 months) and **instant cashback** on selected credit cards (e.g., ICICI, Axis, or American Express) which can reduce the effective price.\n*   **Official Source:** For the most accurate and up-to-date pricing tailored to your preferred memory and storage configuration, please visit the [Apple India Mac store](https://www.apple.com/in/shop/buy-mac)."}
{"step_index":36,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T20:08:50Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-20T01:38:50+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-09-20T01:38:58+05:30\nThe search for \"Apple Mac Pro M2 Ultra price India 2025 2026 iMac M4 price India current\" returned the following summary:\nAs of September 2026, here is the status and pricing information for the requested Apple products in India:\n\n### **iMac (M4 Chip)**\nThe iMac featuring the M4 chip is currently available in India. It was officially launched in October 2024.\n*   **Current Pricing:** The starting price for the iMac (M4) in India is typically **₹1,34,900**, though pricing can vary based on the specific configuration (e.g., storage, memory, and glass options) and current retail offers.\n*   **Availability:** You can purchase it through the official Apple Store (India), Apple Authorised Resellers, and major online retailers. Many retailers offer promotions, such as bank cashback (often ranging from ₹4,000 to ₹8,000) or No Cost EMI options, which can bring the effective purchase price down to approximately **₹1,26,900** for the base model.\n\n### **Mac Pro (M2 Ultra)**\nThe Mac Pro powered by the M2 Ultra chip remains a high-end professional workstation in Apple's lineup.\n*   **Pricing:** As it is a professional-grade machine with highly customizable specifications (CPU/GPU core counts, RAM, and SSD storage), the price varies significantly depending on the configuration. \n*   **Availability:** While it is a standard part of the Apple silicon lineup, some specific configurations may occasionally show as \"out of stock\" at certain third-party premium resellers, requiring orders to be placed directly through the Apple Store or through authorized enterprise channels. \n*   **Note:** Because this model has been on the market for some time, it is recommended to check the official [Apple India website](https://www.apple.com/in/) for the most accurate, real-time pricing based on your required hardware specifications."}
