{"step_index":38,"source":"MODEL","type":"GENERIC","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-19T20:09:04Z","content":"Created At: 2026-09-20T01:39:04+05:30\nCompleted At: 2026-09-20T01:39:09+05:30\nThe search for \"Mac Mini M4 32GB upgrade price India apple store \"₹\" configuration 2025\" returned the following summary:\nThe Apple Mac Mini with the M4 chip, released in late 2024, features unified memory that is integrated into the chip architecture and **cannot be upgraded after purchase**[1][2]. You must select your preferred memory configuration at the time of purchase[1].\n\n### Configuration and Pricing Overview\nWhile the M4 Mac Mini base model launched with a starting price of **₹59,900** (featuring 16GB RAM and 256GB SSD)[3][4], pricing and availability for specific custom configurations (like 32GB RAM) can vary based on official Apple Store listings, authorized resellers, and current market promotions[5][6].\n\n*   **Memory Configuration:** The standard M4 chip supports 16GB of unified memory, which is configurable to **24GB or 32GB** at the time of purchase[7][2].\n*   **Availability Note:** As of late 2026, newer models (such as those featuring M5 or M6 chips) have been introduced to the Apple lineup[8][9][10]. You may find the M4 models primarily through third-party retailers or clearance inventory rather than as a primary custom-order option on the main Apple Store page[11].\n\n### Buying Advice for 2025/2026\n*   **Check Official Apple Store (IN):** Always visit the [official Apple India website](https://www.apple.com/in/shop/buy-mac/mac-mini) to see the most current, tax-inclusive pricing for available configurations.\n*   **Customization:** Because the RAM is soldered to the chip, if you anticipate needing 32GB for demanding tasks (like video editing or AI workflows), it is highly recommended to configure it during the initial purchase[1][12].\n*   **Market Prices:** Retailers like Amazon India and Flipkart often run festive sales (such as the Great Indian Festival) where you may find the M4 Mac Mini at prices lower than the original launch MRP due to bank discounts and seasonal offers[2][6].\n\nFor the most accurate price on a 32GB configuration, you should check the \"Buy\" page for the Mac Mini on the Apple India website, or contact an Apple Authorised Reseller who can provide quotes for specific customized units[5][13].\n\nSources:\n[1] [apple.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQHfWoijd90gJPg_rBy-fUIqL6BobfSrjzJ1C-UR1_So8DOvtuo4U5Fxxh-I90dyZnPhRmSZ34t_1VdVvlK-7m0A9qcExWE_uqswZAME5-W1CVTm82jT12Ch8tCfwg==)\n[2] [indiatoday.in](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQEnJfE8IJ13ZL-laoEeOlkJF3SyN_U7b6waF8ZjhFcLeFIwbgKIfqt5jcaTFpHUIDnlt5BRGClssUNBuSz-d6qnmW-0CXAYb66DGLY7FOwh_QHIM4iUo4GAFyWtpX-a02PsWjvFALzjHRi67ExfwhsMBX2WA4LIhE9pHGZMoAfbcjRibMdzPsire4dOVJtvUERMbjLMYnoCW5EtWK96eP5719nHf0ekMNqtvoi4SShrUO1HGIwZL3OahjZkjs0Btd-r3kz4sg==)\n[3] [financialexpress.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF-fbSvODVqw44m6KWkg_QGhrZ_E017qgy4_0v3sAzY2Xkn_0i6roOAFjzpgP2UdtG0XZz-XbVjOKOND39rdd-wnZuZJxYdCGHB1aSoYo-DN0Mofng9xXXadKFrTYC1ywJeIDJpp3KSfS2iPLIySA_pSHmuokq5b-1_3b27SL5pidrPjrZZhSW_rBlhPwEsC63p1h31-QANx5-SfpetG8igL2nJPXMsPEB_fd8sWFH_DcVFGpubbhpyXmbC1LCopPHuVpTe_PdKjIwm2pIg2Il-riLc2mU=)\n[4] [apple.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQG3C_WxvNXTZZthVzDy4VX8KliRZiynfLhkOccYSe-B0YR2X5t2ZnmgRENHKkR0jm61XtfN84wiWtEGh32VJdA9vL4Jbuaz9wy2B2b60ZuCfD7AdhVMsp78xtPqkBuSaY2FhLSGTUox2Ch22UjziYLXl9EzKKQMWk4KA0p8ZYiHB_zXZQVGFPan2mVrD30Ju1giljUQe8kj2NUer9bvbI2pFkTQUz27-dqagBKJBa0=)\n[5] [indiaistore.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQFdLWA-0Y2XkvJHfVuc6uWW_B44KtrmqOeCJT1lynEfjdDqgo2pAegDlzqc3dYD6Kg-4gSijqtZKfO4cWfvgfOdyvu4RZTR4fT1SxJxoHQWZnD9Nj6j)\n[6] [zingoy.com](https://vertexaisearch.cloud.google.com/grounding-api-redirect/AUZIYQF-icpakzJqMlxN57YVpisRi1ZSLvLsvRnZg1